      "updated": 1771264773104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "main backend lies here, \nthe n8n and workflow, that\nthat fetches each users,\nproblems list, and generates, \na recent activity report, \ncreates a pdf and sends a\nsummary report to user.",
      "fontSize": 33.44717261904761,
