      "text": "LeetBot, an ai chatbot that will, \nhandle user's query, each user will have an\npdf attached to their mail with every \nreceived report. This pdf will be uploaded\non chatbot by the user. After this the \nai chatbot will help the user clear their \ndoubts if any. Else will give a structured\nrevision plan and to do problems for,\nupcoming days and coding sessions.",
      "fontSize": 31.05671296296298,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LeetBot, an ai chatbot that will, \nhandle user's query, each user will have an\npdf attached to their mail with every \nreceived report. This pdf will be uploaded\non chatbot by the user. After this the \nai chatbot will help the user clear their \ndoubts if any. Else will give a structured\nrevision plan and to do problems for,\nupcoming days and coding sessions.",
      "autoResize": true,
